74 80 CREATE RESERVED_KEYWORD
81 89 FUNCTION UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
90 111 IDENT NO_KEYWORD
111 112 ASCII_40 NO_KEYWORD
112 113 ASCII_41 NO_KEYWORD
114 121 RETURNS UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
122 129 BOOLEAN_P COL_NAME_KEYWORD
130 132 AS RESERVED_KEYWORD
133 575 SCONST NO_KEYWORD
576 584 LANGUAGE UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
585 592 IDENT NO_KEYWORD
